<div class="navgroup"><div class="navtitle">Advanced</div><div class="nav"><button onclick="show('advanced',this)">🧰 <span>Advanced tools</span></button></div></div></aside>
<section class="main"><header class="topbar"><strong id="title">Organize</strong><span class="badge">● Temporary processing only</span></header><main class="content">
<section class="hero"><div><h1>Powerful PDFs.<br>Private by design.</h1><p>Professional controls for everyday PDF work — with the same core tools you already have, now presented with a cleaner, more precise workflow.</p></div><div class="shield">🛡️</div></section>


<div id="pp6GlobalToolbar" class="pp6-topbar">

